{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Two arrangements.</b> According to the number of the tribes, like the sod of the ephod and the breastpiece, or two tenths, according to the number of the arrangements." "<b>On the pure table.</b> In contrast to the tables of others upon which there is [bread]; and it alone is overlaid with gold, and its border is gold."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:06.456024511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}